{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0563_1000_008tak", "source_sha256": "893f36ae710ae57b7cf7821b798d2c0f222e2104339f829a079ac286f0e678fb", "ja": "{$P$}……あの……\n大丈夫そうですか？", "zh": "{$P$}……那个……\n看起来还好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0563_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ca266053491be28030833c7481cae7df25a9e55d2d5455a1a524c54a383ca52b", "ja": "……大丈夫、準備はできてる。\nけど、ちょっとだけ緊張しているな……。", "zh": "……没关系，已经准备好了。\n不过，还是稍微有点紧张啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0563_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "a9402b0afd944385ce17d4419023a9a1f5d586c0d777de0e6a39558cb90b148f", "ja": "申し訳ありません……しかし、\nこのようなこと、あなた様にしか頼めないのです。", "zh": "非常抱歉……但是，\n这种事，只有您才能帮我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0563_1003_p", "source_sha256": "9ae9938e6e999c25c3b969072c3a236785998bd6f8a7451a62011b0cd64d5a72", "ja": "わかるよ……貴音の本気を受け止められるのが\n自分であることを、誇らしく思っている。", "zh": "我明白……能由自己来接纳贵音的认真，我感到很自豪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0563_1004_008tak", "source_sha256": "761127c3dae2c6ad5e2c7dd919e8a4da707f9f59e8c92b176e0c27e33683c526", "ja": "私も、こうしてあなた様のアイドルで\nいられることに、真、感謝しています。", "zh": "我也由衷感谢自己能这样成为您的偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0563_1005_008tak", "source_sha256": "d14a07bb617498994e926aeada9b0f642aeee42b63d554fae94e12c45e723da9", "ja": "では……そろそろ参ります。", "zh": "那么……差不多该走了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0563_1006_p", "source_sha256": "17513beab17113139829def8bfa8843e9961a1b5d1e54ad00c9fc3708c307857", "ja": "ああ……いや、ちょっと待って。確認なんだけど、\nドラマのアクションシーンの練習なんだよな？", "zh": "啊……不，等一下。我确认一下啊，\n这是在练习电视剧里的动作戏，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0563_1007_p", "source_sha256": "07009f354740229b28762c419e0b43a13c91cd4b241d17c2c3c9ec85fe2a18b0", "ja": "貴音の繰り出す、巻物の攻撃を受けるっていう……。", "zh": "也就是说，要承受贵音施展出的卷轴攻击……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0563_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "6d00af49e2fc85af99bbae0f1af5cc825e05471e7cbc323c326d571b629ad9df", "ja": "はい。かかしを相手に練習していたのですが、\nやはり、手ごたえが掴めず。", "zh": "是的。我之前一直对着稻草人练习，但果然还是抓不住手感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0563_1009_008tak", "source_sha256": "0fbba3f6ca4e67333e321de7168b01d3638acacb38c26614d19778dc6a0de2ec", "ja": "撮影の際、相手役の千早に、\n傷を付けるようなことがあっては忍びないと……。", "zh": "拍摄时，我想着要是让和我演对手戏的千早受了伤，那就太过意不去了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0563_1010_p", "source_sha256": "affbad38d25109aa6d59801c11b592920dfc371fc67906a37f20c62c484d8370", "ja": "確かに、難しいアクションだもんな。\n……その布、すごく痛……いや、丈夫そうだな。", "zh": "确实，那个动作挺难的。\n……那块布，看起来好疼……不，挺结实的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0563_1011_008tak", "source_sha256": "ec1ff8fccbaa80fd5d3f31e1ed094680781de59ea9d6ec9a0260a01d2fc80213", "ja": "じいやが、張り切って用意してくれたのです。", "zh": "是管家爷爷特意兴致勃勃准备的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0563_1012_p", "source_sha256": "dba441a515480bd85570077f83181caec7c995ac7de96f9b14dfa134dc8c19b6", "ja": "そうか、よろしく伝えておいてくれ……。", "zh": "这样啊，替我向他问好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0563_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a7e3e0d3e428b803196592e6aeaf4e80b7a77dd634ba443642a613f1dbc3d4e4", "ja": "……よし、覚悟はできた、やってくれ！", "zh": "……好，我已经做好觉悟了，来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0563_1014_008tak", "source_sha256": "039e1c5b14518b5a9c185d4bfff8d6545066a3ec665834e77c43823753b17444", "ja": "まずは、防御の姿勢をとっていただいて……\n両腕から封じてみましょうか。", "zh": "首先，请先摆好防御姿势……\n要不要先从双臂开始封住呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0563_1015_008tak", "source_sha256": "fbe7fd80c0bc75d1f2e239e42fee2765fd1ae2e00292fa59d2a78b2321207865", "ja": "それから脚……いえ、顔でしょうか？\nひとまずやってみましょう……いざ！", "zh": "然后是腿……不，还是脸吗？\n总之先试试看吧……上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_008tak0563_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_008tak0563_1016_p", "source_sha256": "9ae38ea08cd78cb4b0039f4c713bd87944130b68086a3f8ca1759aae6e938b32", "ja": "あ、顔もやるんだっけ。念のためだけどそっと頼むな！\n鼻は開けといてもらえると……もがっ！", "zh": "啊，脸也要做来着。先说好，要轻一点啊！\n鼻子要是能露出来就好了……唔嘎！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
